#: imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:70 imageplugin_lensdistortion.cpp:62
msgid "Lens Distortion Correction"
msgstr "लेन्स विरुपण सुधार"

#: imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:72
msgid ""
"A digiKam image plugin to reduce spherical aberration caused by a lens to an "
"image."
msgstr "गोलाकार अपसरणको कारणले छविमा लेन्सद्धारा घटाउने डिजिक्याम छवि प्लगइन ।"

#: imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:80
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "लेखक र सम्भारकर्ता"

#: imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:83
msgid "Developer"
msgstr "विकासकर्ता"

#: imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:86
msgid "Lens distortion correction algorithm."
msgstr "लेन्स विरुपण सुधार अल्गोरिदम ।"

#: imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:98
msgid ""
"<p>You can see here a thumbnail preview of the distortion correction applied "
"to a cross pattern."
msgstr ""
"<p>तपाईँले यहाँ क्रस बान्कीमा लागू हुने विरुपण सुधारको थम्बनेल पूर्वावलोकन "
"हेर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।"

#: imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:104
msgid "Main:"
msgstr "मूख्य:"

#: imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:109
msgid ""
"<p>This value controls the amount of distortion. Negative values correct "
"lens barrel distortion, while positive values correct lens pincushion "
"distortion."
msgstr ""
"<p>यो मानले विरुपणको मात्रालाई नियन्त्रण गर्दछ । ऋणात्मक मानले लेन्स "
"ब्यारेल विरुपण सुधार गर्दछ, जबकी धनात्मक मानले लेन्स पिन्कुसन विरुपण "
"सुधार गर्दछ ।"

#: imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:117
msgid "Edge:"
msgstr "किनारा:"

#: imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:122
msgid ""
"<p>This value controls in the same manner as the Main control, but has more "
"effect at the edges of the image than at the center."
msgstr "<p>यो मान मूख्य नियन्त्रण जस्तै गरेर नियन्त्रण गरिन्छ, तर छविको केन्द्रमा भन्दा किनारामा बढी प्रभाव पर्दछ ।"

#: imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:130
msgid "Zoom:"
msgstr "जूम:"

#: imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:135
msgid "<p>This value rescales the overall image size."
msgstr "<p>यो मानले समग्र छवि साइज पुन: मापन गर्दछ ।"

#: imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:142
msgid "Brighten:"
msgstr "चम्किलो:"

#: imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:147
msgid "<p>This value adjusts the brightness in image corners."
msgstr "<p>यो मानले छविका कुनामा चम्किलोपना समायोजन गर्दछ ।"

#: imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:302
msgid "Lens Distortion"
msgstr "लेन्स विरुपण"

#: imageplugin_lensdistortion.cpp:42
msgid "Lens Distortion Correction..."
msgstr "लेन्स विरुपण सुधार..."

